 "remarks": "Welcome to 12 Lambert Common, a spacious three-bedroom, two-and-a-half-bath townhouse tucked away from the road in sought-after South Wilton. Offering three levels of living space and numerous recent improvements, this inviting home combines comfort, privacy, and convenience. The spacious living and dining area features hardwood floors, a fireplace, and sliders to a private stone patio with mature plantings and a peaceful space. The bright eat-in kitchen offers a charming bay window, new countertop, sink, faucet, disposal, and dishwasher. A powder room completes the main level. Upstairs, the generously sized primary bedroom features a private full bath, while two additional bedrooms share a hall bath. All second-floor windows have been replaced. The finished lower-level family room offers flexible space for entertaining, a home office, fitness, or recreation and a new high-performance washer and dryer. Additional highlights include storage, a new hot water heater, detached one-car garage, and assigned parking. Convenient to Wilton Center, Westport, New Canaan, Metro-North, shopping, dining, and major routes. With spacious interiors, thoughtful updates, and a tranquil setting, 12 Lambert Common offers comfortable, low-maintenance living. Please see the complete list of upgrades and improvements list in photos",
